## Generated Commands by Context

AlwaysIncludeCommands { /help, /plan, /task, /review, /commit, /explain, /debug }

CommandsByContext {
  TeamTool+ => /discover, /execute, /log
  MVP+ => /feature, /journey
  BusinessRisk+ => /security-review
}

## Output Files

OutputFiles {
  choices.mdc => source of truth (L1-L5 with explicit/inferred markers)
  rules/core.mdc => derived from L1 + L2
  rules/stack/*.mdc => derived from L3-L5, calibrated to L1 + L2
  rules/patterns/*.mdc => spec-driven generation patterns
  rules/effects.mdc => effect isolation (if async in stack)
  rules/agent-orchestrator.mdc => agent dispatch (if multiple specialized rules)
}
